= Ore
Ore is a system monitoring tool written in rust by myself for myself.

== Ideas that could be fun to add
- querying the system stats through discord, telegram or similar
- logging of data in some way (f.x. DB, json, csv)
- add temperature readings on mac (looks kinda involved as seen [here](https://medium.com/@vladkens/how-to-get-macos-power-metrics-with-rust-d42b0ad53967))
